<headroom-rig>
<metadata preset-name="Pedal Steel Swells" preset-author="Headroom" preset-comment="A steel-guitar imitation: heavy compression for long sustain, a warm big blackface twin, a soft quarter-note echo and a long plate. Pick with the guitar volume off, then roll it up into the note; bend one string of a double-stop while the other holds. Sustain and Plate set how far each swell blooms." based-on="" based-on-path=""/>
